const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"一天中的信息吸收是否相同？",en:"Does information arrive evenly?"},body:{zh:"Chen、Cai与Ho关注价格发现如何在交易日内变化。开盘、连续交易与收盘拥有不同的信息环境；把它们平均成一天，可能掩盖市场机制的重要差别。",en:"Chen, Cai and Ho examine how price discovery changes within a trading day. Opening, continuous trading and closing have different information environments that daily aggregation can hide."}},{title:{zh:"历史交易阶段是样本的一部分",en:"Historical session phases are part of the sample"},body:{zh:"原文市场结构段落区分早盘开盘集合竞价、上午连续交易、午间休市和下午交易。编辑建议：为2004—2005年样本保留当时的阶段标签，不把午休当作随机缺失，也不要直接套用今日制度。相同钟点在不同交易阶段，可能代表不同的信息环境。",en:"The market-structure passage separates the opening call auction, morning continuous trading, lunch closure and afternoon trading. Editorial application: retain historical phase labels for the 2004–2005 sample. Lunch is not a random gap, and present-day rules should not be assumed. Clock time alone does not identify the information environment."},reference:{url:"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S1043951X0900039X",label:{zh:"期刊页面章节预览：Market structure",en:"Journal section preview: Market structure"}}},{title:{zh:"研究依赖逐笔交易与报价",en:"Trades and quotes are distinct inputs"},body:{zh:"作者使用2004年6月至2005年5月上海证券交易所180只成分股的报价与成交资料，考察报价价差、有效价差及价格无偏性。只拥有五分钟行情或日收盘价，不能重建原研究的全部观测。",en:"The sample contains trades and quotes for 180 Shanghai stocks from June 2004 through May 2005. Quoted spreads, effective spreads and price unbiasedness require information that daily closes or five-minute bars cannot fully recover."}},{title:{zh:"读模式，也读适用条件",en:"Read patterns with their conditions"},body:{zh:"摘要报告价差在开盘较高、随后下降、收盘略有回升，并发现更高流动性股票的日内价格更接近所检验的有效与无偏特征。不同交易规模在不同时段的作用也不同，不能概括为“大单总是更有信息”。",en:"Reported spreads are high at the open, decline and rise slightly at the close. More liquid stocks appear more efficient under the tests. Trade-size roles vary by session; large trades are not uniformly more informative."}},{title:{zh:"先分清价差问题与无偏性问题",en:"Spreads and unbiasedness ask different questions"},body:{zh:"交易成本分析关心买卖价差，而无偏性回归考察日内价格与后续价格发现的关系。出版方预览说明后者使用收盘到收盘收益作为被解释对象。编辑建议：分别记录报价配对、收益基准和观测时点；价差较小不能单独证明价格已吸收全部信息。",en:"Trading-cost analysis concerns spreads, while unbiasedness regressions examine intraday prices relative to subsequent price discovery. The publisher preview identifies close-to-close returns as the dependent object. Editorial application: document quote matching, return benchmarks and observation times separately. A narrow spread alone does not establish complete information incorporation."},reference:{url:"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S1043951X0900039X",label:{zh:"期刊页面章节预览：Unbiasedness regressions",en:"Journal section preview: Unbiasedness regressions"}}},{title:{zh:"在不同尺度之间保持概念清楚",en:"Keep time scales distinct"},body:{zh:"长期盈利信息与日内价格发现相互关联，但度量和样本要求不同。本站建议保留交易所时钟、报价与成交类型、交易阶段和缺失记录，再决定能回答什么问题，不用数据频率高低替代质量判断。",en:"Long-horizon profit information and intraday discovery are related but require different measures. Preserve exchange clocks, quote/trade identity, session phase and gaps before deciding which question the data can answer."}}],readerLimits:{zh:"样本仅覆盖特定时期与成分股；市场制度已可能变化。导读不是当前日内效率诊断，低频行情也不是原样本替代品。",en:"The sample is period- and constituent-specific. This is not a current efficiency diagnosis, and low-frequency bars are not equivalent to its original observations."}};export{e as default};
